  "contract": [
    "Drive ContinuityReader through its ContainerReader implementation, verify the source capabilities and initial request, enumerate the announced tracks, and close after EOF.",
    "Read the complete mpegts-access-units corpus through the selected program, advancing ordered entities and flushing at a declared discontinuity. The reference uses the public parser-enabled MPEG-TS demuxer with NOFILLIN, without stream discovery.",
    "The packet record compares stream index, PID, demux PTS and DTS, duration, position, flags, payload length and bytes, and time base. A following record compares each side-data element in order. Clean end requires consuming the last physical entity.",
    "Compare the packet consequence of a continuity residue. Check its physical source end, original carrier bytes, ordered source-event ordinals, selected PID, clock-discontinuity epoch and matching typed gap or duplicate fault. The candidate appends the source end and ordered carriers. The reference derives the corresponding wire check from counter gaps and copies, their confirming fault diagnostics and a new time base coded by a signalled discontinuity's PCR, in the original single entity, when it emits an opaque AVC or HEVC packet. A residue stands for the strict packets of its PID that start within its run, whose bytes it must hold in order; those strict packets are compared in ts-reader-views.",
    "A library refusal ends the candidate's fold with one kind 8 record; a failed check of the worker's own ends the worker with an error, which no registry entry admits."
  ],
